5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. We have a werewolf and a possessed among us. The best way to start is by observing who tries too hard to blend in.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with a calm approach. It is better to listen first and see how everyone reacts before we make any hasty accusations.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want us all to work together! If we are honest and supportive, I'm sure we can find the werewolf quickly.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not hiding anything! Just tell me who looks suspicious and I'll help you take them down.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer to stay quiet and observe. Knowledge often comes to those who listen more than they speak.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, that mysterious aura of yours is exactly what I'm talking about. Silence can be a shield for the enemy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. Let's not jump to conclusions. Being introverted isn't a crime.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I think we should encourage everyone to share their thoughts! Maybe the Seer can give us a hint tomorrow?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Why are you picking on Jonathan? If you're so smart, Shunichi, why don't you just find the wolf yourself?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I simply value my peace. I have no reason to lie to any of you.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your aggression is interesting. Defending others too quickly can be a sign of a partnership.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,It's just the enthusiasm of youth. Let's focus on a strategy for tomorrow's vote.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I agree with George. Let's see if anyone's story changes after the first night.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not partnering with anyone! I'm just sick of you acting like you know everything!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,We've established the personalities. I'll be watching for contradictions in your logic tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I will rely on the evidence provided. I'm ready for the night.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll do my best to help everyone! Good luck tonight!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever! I'm not the wolf, so just wait and see!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall return to my thoughts. Good night.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
