36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The morning is here. Since no one died yet, the game truly begins now. Who has something to tell us?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,I'm waiting to see if anyone has a lead. I don't want to vote blindly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi last night. He is the Werewolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a lie! You're just making things up to get me kicked out!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That is a very bold claim to make so early. Are we certain we can trust Yumi?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, coming out as Seer immediately is a risky move. However, @Takumi, your reaction is predictably emotional.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"This is sudden. Yumi, are you absolutely sure about your divination?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I am! I saw it clearly. Takumi is the one we need to execute to save the village!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not the wolf! Yumi is lying to protect herself or someone else! You're all falling for it!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is difficult to know who is telling the truth. Perhaps we should consider other possibilities.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, you're being very neutral. It's almost as if you're trying to deflect the focus away from the wolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"If Yumi is the Seer, the choice is simple. But if she's the wolf lying... this is tricky.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm not lying! Why would I reveal myself if I were the wolf? I want to help us win!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Because she's crazy! Don't listen to her! I'm just a kid, why would I be the wolf?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Logic suggests that the Seer is the most valuable role. We should be careful about who we believe.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Takumi's defense is purely emotional, while Yumi's is direct. I'm leaning toward Yumi's information.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,I trust Yumi's kindness. I believe she is telling the truth about Takumi.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Please, trust me! We have to vote for Takumi now before more of us are attacked!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I hate this! You're all idiots if you believe her! I'm not the wolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will vote according to my intuition, though I remain skeptical.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
